  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* v3.1.3: Updated to Ktor 3.1.3. Transitive-dep floors that moved since 3.1.0:\n\t\t\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core(:-jvm) 0.6.0 -> 0.7.0\n\t\t\t\t\t\t(required bumping the XDev.KotlinX.IO wrapper knob 0.6.0.1 -> 0.7.0.1; this floor\n\t\t\t\t\t\t comes from the transitive ktor-io module, which the auto-updater does not track)\n\t\t\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-*(:-jvm) 1.8.0 -> 1.8.1 (already satisfied; knob at 1.8.1)\n\t\t\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core(:-slf4j) 1.10.1 -> 1.10.2 (already satisfied)\n\t\t\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-stdlib 2.1.10 -> 2.1.20 (already satisfied; knob kept ahead at 2.3.21)\n\t\t\t\t\t- No new Ktor modules; okio-jvm and slf4j-api floors unchanged.\n\t\t\t* v3.1.0: Updated to Ktor 3.1.0. Transitive-dep floors bumped to match:\n\t\t\t\t\t- com.squareup.okio:okio-jvm 3.9.1 -> 3.10.2\n\t\t\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-* 1.7.3 -> 1.8.1\n\t\t\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core 0.5.4 -> 0.6.0\n\t\t\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json-io 1.7.3 -> 1.8.1\n\t\t\t\t\t- io.ktor:ktor-http-cio(:-jvm) added (new Ktor module)\n\t\t\t\t\t- io.ktor:ktor-network(:-jvm) added (new Ktor module, required by ktor-http-cio)\n\t\t\t\t\t- Nuget dependency change: dropped Xamarin.Kotlin.StdLib.Common/.Jdk7/.Jdk8 NuGet refs:\n\t\t\t\t\t\tKotlin 2.x folds these into the base kotlin-stdlib,\n\t\t\t\t\t\tand Ktor 3.1.0 only declares a dep on kotlin-stdlib.\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBase Xamarin.Kotlin.StdLib is retained, with nuget version tracking the native version.",
